F8nSj7iPlnIRHSzf6r_dIjTj6P0X7X6QK739PMGlVozA&oe=6A819B84"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "467916352871409", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003282_467916356204742_1871921057092171900_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ulo6P3uXyHAQ7kNvwHIAaX5&_nc_oc=AdpIDZUa-aPB1M6MY0XbHdrV3TYr_NII0D1uQL_yNXcN2PRPvbgQ8hvR6n2pjAPhKDc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQH-HchQRcmP4pOqOzJ50-hXkyW9-b8WHRBG13wZ8-LiwA&oe=6A81B862"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1934382610375855", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974473_1934382613709188_7156337812617042679_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=slmk--1hXw4Q7kNvwEyt1Sj&_nc_oc=Adqam8TrFuqekyM1e2FrqgvPctbhvQK9ObTpF3umztems8TbHzMtXQIR0KkHEofkw8g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEQw4A-9b_ChDg68ZHlPNICP4ZvOl7psFTYOccvwGt2Og&oe=6A81A273"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "landscape.png", "id": "1524760081483769", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974531_1524760084817102_6497712644828891067_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=S4zDneBS-BQQ7kNvwGQ0kXu&_nc_oc=AdoDeBqkXjnHcWto_GrPg-mKTQhjD0JMlqTPsV9JLDW9k8cJVS3AovpwzfrJhdOUF-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQERMDtsb4TgBML-qfKu04mjNq1TV4wJR9e8dzHvdUOysg&oe=6A81A16F"}, "display_name": "Mystery Box VR: Hidden Secrets", "keywords": [], "long_description": " AN IMMERSIVE VR PUZZLE EXPERIENCE\nInteract with objects, handles, buttons, and wheels on each side. Crack enigmas and collect hidden puzzle tiles on a random side of the boxes.\n\nYou won't be able to compare reality with fiction.\n\n# DISCOVER INVENTIONS\nOnce you unlock all 8 boxes of a Level Pack, you can compose a puzzle and discover a brief history of an invention.\n\nIt's not always easy to escape the room, so use all your IQ to crack the riddles. There's a logic behind all of them, even where it seems it's not!\n\n# IMMERSIVE SOUNDTRACK\nPlay the game with your headphones to get immersed in this amazing adventure.\n\n# HINTS\nGot stuck on some enigma? No worries, you can still get a helpful hint! You can also get in touch with me in case you really can't make it through a riddle, I'll be glad to help ;)\n\n# MULTILANGUAGE\nAvailable in English, French, Italian, German, Spanish, Russian, and Japanese.\n\nThe game language will change automatically based on the language settings of your device", "short_description": "A VR escape room game where you have to solve intriguing riddles to open boxes and discover nice stories about popular inventions!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "$R36BSY5.png", "id": "3678762505771822", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031430_3678762509105155_2151975047074617165_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IePZYcabk4AQ7kNvwGHRcv4&_nc_oc=AdqeEWPHcXpQcVvQ2qyVDwrU7gv41rzTTneglHXMzpv1naNTF4MHRxThP0O806dV7vw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF2ZnhruK9KQF3wDcKnJFaqLDWzvz0Gx2BCT4uGQNGA_A&oe=6A819D65"}, {"file_name": "$R81V725.png", "id": "2720695481426567", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262743_2720695484759900_604086922326600035_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6psLyBricCUQ7kNvwFVxt0O&_nc_oc=AdrKzuOnGlvXeN8MD_3lDUA3de8VmnAKE71DAjvL1287VVYhg8xd4rqr6AzGY9CHSPQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHz6goVDi21pBDWfrfIPU6PhHWNFUTrZ15gaZDbv8ez4g&oe=6A819C4D"}, {"file_name": "$RQ3SN6U.png", "id": "1552311425628973", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982519_1552311428962306_1218130395049083834_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rXasxUfX2bwQ7kNvwHVio3Q&_nc_oc=Adqsour2E1QJSHQzGw3lWplrUgFjhqDEPSZagRHNfYGPorXZxhXE5uHPioIhdJB5r18&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=